No Autodesk software, header, library or binary is included in or distributed by
this repository:

  * The AutoCAD .NET API is consumed through the publicly available AutoCAD.NET
    NuGet package, referenced with ExcludeAssets="runtime". Those assemblies are
    used for compilation only; AutoCAD supplies them at run time from its own
    installation.

  * The AutoCAD Architecture assemblies (AecBaseMgd, AecArchMgd and related) are
    referenced by path from the user's own AutoCAD Architecture installation,
    with <Private>false</Private> so they are never copied to the build output.
    They are not redistributed here in any form.

  * Roslyn (Microsoft.CodeAnalysis) is referenced from AutoCAD's own installed
    copies rather than from NuGet, deliberately, because AutoCAD already loads
    those assemblies into the process.

